OL,3,GNEWSAPub's toucan mural saved on appeal
OL,4,
OL,5,FA pub's hand-painted mural based on the
OL,6,Fold Guinness toucan adverts has been
OL,7,Fsaved thanks to a successful appeal
OL,8,Fagainst an order for its removal.
OL,10,FDurham County Council refused to grant
OL,11,Fretrospective permission to display the
OL,12,Fartwork, at the Boat Club in Durham
OL,13,Fbecause of "its excessive size, scale
OL,14,Fand stark colour".
OL,16,FBut a government planning inspector
OL,17,Fsaid while the colour was "bright", it
OL,18,Fwas not more noticeable than the "large
OL,19,Fturquoise tower" of the Prince Bishops
OL,20,Fcar park behind it.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
