OL,3,GNEWSAPub's toucan mural saved on appeal
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Boat Club falls within Durham's
OL,6,Fconservation area, but is not listed.
OL,7,FOwner Howard Eggleston had previously
OL,8,Fsaid the mural cost about #7,000 and
OL,9,Ftook a week to complete.
